  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001099",
        "SRC-001107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-23-609: Monterey Road Apartments, located at 4300 & 4310 Monterey Road in San Jose, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $5,794,275 in annual federal tax credits to finance the new construction of 237 units of housing serving tenants with rents affordable to households earning 30%-70% of area median income (AMI). Recorded as a note because this funding covers Monterey Road Apartments (240 units), which may be one component of this record.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001642"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Article reports nearly $71 million in construction financing. SJ Build shows a December 2024 preliminary review (PRE24-355) to replace two buildings of 126 units with parking stackers.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001793"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit H20-024 (Site Development Permit/Amendment, folder year 2020), status Approved, issue date 2021-12-17: \"***CONVERTED FROM CP20-018*** SB 35 Ministerial Permit to allow mixed-use project with 1,075 square feet of retail and 426 affordable, residential units on a 2.29-gross acre site.\"",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit HA20-024-01 (Ministerial Permit, folder year 2023), status Approved, issue date 2024-05-09: \"SB 35 Streamlined Ministerial Permit Amendment to decrease the number of units from 426 multi-family units to 366 multifamily units; reduce the height of the buildings from approximately 76 feet, 6 inches to approximately 70 feet, 6 inches; change the pha\" (city text cut off at 255 characters)",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CTCAC staff report (2023-12-06): construction-period sources also list deferred costs of $1,979,480, deferred developer fee of $11,800,000 and tax credit equity of $9,733,408. Approved developer fee $11,800,000. Bond issuer CMFA; management agent ConAm Management Corporation.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001642"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: Building 1 has 124 units in 67,750 sq ft plus 1,420 sq ft of retail; Building 2 has 116 units in 54,800 sq ft. Parking uses stackers in each podium. Three units are market-rate manager units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001792"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AO Architects describes the project as 3D volumetric modular construction over a podium, with modules by Prefab Logic, and lists AO as design architect and architect of record.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002539"
      ]
    }
  ],
